Before planning or editing, read `docs/PRD.md` (the product requirements) and
`AGENTS.md` (agent rules). They define the personal CV sample project, its data
contract (`app/data/cv.ts`, `app/types/cv.ts`, `useCv()`), and the creative
freedom allowed in layout and styling. Target Nuxt 4 stable only.
